{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33998","headline":"奉和鲁望秋赋有期次韵 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望秋赋有期次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载江湖尽是闲，客儿诗句满人间。\n郡侯闻誉亲邀得，乡老知名不放还。\n应带瓦花经汴水，更携云实出包山。\n太微宫里环冈树，无限瑶枝待尔攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}